# Run units (training data, weights) live in the shared NN-KNN/runs/; generated summaries go to
# results/ (ignored); hand-written reports in reports/ are tracked. Old generated files under
# reports/ and docs/experiments/ on the experiment host stay ignored (owner's rules O1-O3, 2026-11-22).
/results/
/logs/
/runs/
/reports/figures/
/reports/*.csv
/reports/*.json
/reports/*.txt
/reports/*.png
/docs/experiments/*.csv

# Data and preprocessed caches live in the shared NN-KNN/datasets (see datasets/paths.py);
# only the loader code datasets/*.py is tracked here.
/datasets/*
!/datasets/*.py
